e": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [], "type": "learning_skills"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le14ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey Ferdinand, aren't you Latino? You're never early! What do you mean by arriving at the bar before me? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I'm not sure I follow you. Miranda said North Americans usually arrive ten minutes before the agreed time. I am making a point of practising punctuality.<br/>"}, {"time": "17500", "image": "engenn6le14ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? You sure are keen. I'm inspired at your efforts. A pat on the back to you, but don't let work affect your social life!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Whatever it takes. But do you mean that it is unusual for North Americans to arrive early to social events?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Some people do. It's not inappropriate. It is acceptable to be a little late for an informal gathering. However, it could be inconsiderate to keep someone waiting for long if it's just the two of you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Like when? I don't get it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well don't be late if you're meeting a woman. Believe me, she'll worry you've stood her up and be embarrassed. Also, you run the risk of another guy picking her up.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I'll keep that in mind.<br/>"}, {"time": "60000", "image": "engenn6le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey, I think you did great with impressing Janet.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: How so?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She's commissioned you as their main PR guy in South America. Is that true?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Yes, along with some guy named Rocco. Do you know him?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice old guy. More on him later - here comes the waiter."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}